@startuml
title Monthly Payroll Computation & Direct Deposit Disbursement Workflow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam ActivityFontColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityFontStyle bold

skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #1d4ed8
skinparam SwimlaneWidth 220
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontColor #1e3a8a
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 14
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold

skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

|Payroll Administrator|
start
:Import Locked Timesheets, OT & Commission Data;
:Execute Automated Gross-to-Net Salary Computation;
:Calculate Tax Withholding & BHXH Insurance Deductions;
:Generate Draft Master Payroll Summary Sheet;

|HR Manager|
:Audit Payroll Master Sheet & Total Cost Variance;
if (Payroll Approved?) then (Approved)
  :Sign Off Monthly Salary Disbursement;
else (Discrepancy)
  :Request Payroll Recalculation Audit;
  stop
endif

|Payroll Administrator|
:Export Bank Direct Deposit Transfer Batch File;
:Transmit File to Direct Deposit Bank;
:Issue Password-Protected Encrypted Digital Payslips;

|Employee|
:Receive Payslip Notification & Bank Net Pay Deposit;
stop
@enduml
